                                                "sense_id": "7b406e5c-09f2-3a2b-b8c5-b7382c3f3d0d",
                                                "text": "lapse in security"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "543a7b66-9ee0-4ff8-87ec-694dd4a2d5b3",
                                                "sense_id": "7b406e5c-09f2-3a2b-b8c5-b7382c3f3d0d",
                                                "text": "lapse in concentration"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9bf3902-0d04-4550-a52c-9ca367e3e2f6",
                                                "sense_id": "7b406e5c-09f2-3a2b-b8c5-b7382c3f3d0d",
                                                "text": "Now, tho’ this Scripture may be usefully understood and apply’d by us as a Caution to guard against those Lapses and Failings to which our Infirmities daily expose us"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2defa61-df6e-32ce-8507-92af4e787919",
                                        "entry_id": "ae0ac9e5-0598-364e-871d-351ffdedb3d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A decline or fall in standards."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f4b5293-bf4d-4bc8-aba8-8e09029257c8",
                                                "sense_id": "f2defa61-df6e-32ce-8507-92af4e787919",
                                                "text": "The lapse to indolence is soft and imperceptible, because it is only a mere cessation of activity"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0cbf6d5f-a1d3-34a9-9e10-50b14d2572e2",
                                        "entry_id": "ae0ac9e5-0598-364e-871d-351ffdedb3d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pause in continuity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e4f41b6-229d-3496-9234-d1e66de104c4",
                                        "entry_id": "ae0ac9e5-0598-364e-871d-351ffdedb3d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An interval of time between events."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "795bd820-9822-46cb-8b40-b9189c62b8b5",
                                                "sense_id": "5e4f41b6-229d-3496-9234-d1e66de104c4",
                                                "text": "Still onward winds the dreary way;\n⁠I with it; for I long to prove\n⁠No lapse of moons can canker Love,\nWhatever fickle tongues may say."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b335b5d-6b62-4d31-b3d4-8d8fbb9707d7",
                                                "sense_id": "5e4f41b6-229d-3496-9234-d1e66de104c4",
                                                "text": "Bacon was content to wait the lapse of long centuries for his expected revenue of fame"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5a4eeb7-8816-3a2f-82e1-41a7aaf6ee93",
                                        "entry_id": "ae0ac9e5-0598-364e-871d-351ffdedb3d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A termination of a right etc., through disuse or neglect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9186b838-fcd1-3722-8c32-90c8afce8d71",
                                        "entry_id": "ae0ac9e5-0598-364e-871d-351ffdedb3d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A marked decrease in air temperature with increasing altitude because the ground is warmer than the surrounding air."
                                        ],
